    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/34135": {
      "title": "Lab Assistant/Peer Mentor",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Lab Assistant/Peer Mentor Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Lab Assistant/Peer Mentor To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20255422V Position Title: Lab Assistant/Peer Mentor Posting Type Student Hours/week: 2-10 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2025-2026 Academic Year Location Driscoll Hall Detailed Work Schedule To be determined and built around class schedule. You need not be available for all dates or times. Looking for availability during the summer and/or Fall and Spring 2025-26. Number of positions: 8-10 Department: 937-FCN Simluation & LRC Contact Name: Gail Furman Contact Phone/Extension: 6105196596 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Peer Mentors (PMs) are assigned to work in the SLRC to provide support to students and the SLRC staff. Support is accomplished in a variety of ways: • Review of basic skills (practicing vital signs and health assessment) • Assist students with Deliberate Practice (DP) including tracking student visits i • Help students with any skills needed (vital signs, BP, catheterization, injections, etc.) • Help with set up and break down of simulation events • Assist with keeping the SLRC maintained Requirements: Students in good academic standing; full-time enrolled College of Nursing student Additional Information: Lab Assistant/Peer Mentors must supply two references from clinical faculty. Please upload these to your application. Physical Demands Summary: Assist with lifting/moving full body sized mannequins in excess of 25 lbs, medical equipment, beds, tables, carts, audiovisual equipment. Requires manual dexterity to manipulate equipment and standing for periods of time. Wage Rate: $10.00 per hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Letters of Reference (uploaded by applicant) Optional Documents Resume / Curriculum Vitae Other Document © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
