    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/35965": {
      "title": "Peer Tutor: The Learners&#39; Studio",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Peer Tutor: The Learners&#39; Studio Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Peer Tutor: The Learners' Studio To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. To be considered, you must also complete the more detailed questionnaire at this link: https://www1.villanova.edu/content/villanova/provost/tutoringservices/peer-tutor-application.html Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260076V Position Title: Peer Tutor: The Learners' Studio Posting Type Student Hours/week: 3-8 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Falvey Memorial Library Detailed Work Schedule Schedules arranged with the Associate Director of Tutoring Services prior to each academic semester. Number of positions: Varies Department: 126-Tutoring Center Contact Name: Juliana Studer Contact Phone/Extension: 6105195862 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Peer Tutors at The Learners’ Studio and The Math Center provide 1:1 tutoring in a variety of subjects. Tutoring can be conducted both in-person and through synchronous online options. Requirements: Must be able to tutor in at least 3 classes running that semester. Must have a B+ or better in the course you wish to tutor for, and two endorsements from faculty in the major area you wish to tutor in. Additional Information: To be considered, you must also complete the more detailed questionnaire at this link . Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: 11.25/HR for Undergrad tutors and 13.00/HR for Grad tutors Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): 05/31/2027 Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae Transcripts © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
