    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36195": {
      "title": "Facilities Attendants &amp; Aides- The Inn at Villanova University",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Facilities Attendants &amp; Aides- The Inn at Villanova University Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Facilities Attendants & Aides- The Inn at Villanova University To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20255627V Position Title: Facilities Attendants & Aides- The Inn at Villanova University Posting Type Student Hours/week: As needed, up to 20 hours per week Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2025-2026 Academic Year Location Inn at Villanova University Detailed Work Schedule Schedule to cover hours of operation at The Inn at Villanova University may include nights and weekends. Number of positions: 2 Department: 507-Inn at Villanova University Contact Name: Richard Kratzinger Contact Phone/Extension: 610-581-3150 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: The Facility Aide reviews Banquet Event Orders to assist in room set ups and moving tables and chairs for the Inn at Villanova. Additionally, will set up and troubleshoot audio visual needs for meeting and groups as needed. Requirements: Additional Information: Assists with additional tasks as assigned. Physical Demands Summary: Must be able to lift and move 60lbs. Wage Rate: 10/HR Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled No Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your ava