    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36396": {
      "title": "Office Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Office Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Office Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260299V Position Title: Office Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 10 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Stanford Hall Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 1 Department: 361-Residence Life Office Contact Name: Susan Farnam Contact Phone/Extension: 4876 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: The Office Assistant position will assist with office work of any kind, including but not limited to, scheduling appointments, internet research, phone coverage, scanning, reception, mailings, filing, data entry, etc. Greet and direct students/visitors Answer phones and direct calls Check OA Mailbox for possible projects Work on projects as assigned Check that printer has all necessary supplies Clean and organize Resource Room Distribute mail or flyers to RAs/staff, per instruc\\ons Other duties as assigned Requirements: Good interpersonal skills are required. This position requires interactions with students and employees. The ability to be discreet with sensitive information is a must. You must possess the ability to travel across campus and occasionally lift 50 lbs or less. Additional Information: Initiative, creativity and strong organizational skills are an asset to this position. Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $10/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled No Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
