    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/35631": {
      "title": "Access Services Technician - Fall 2026",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Access Services Technician - Fall 2026 Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Access Services Technician - Fall 2026 To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260263V Position Title: Access Services Technician - Fall 2026 Posting Type Student Hours/week: 6-10 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Falvey Memorial Library Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 5-8 Department: 288-Falvey Library Contact Name: Lorraine Holt Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-4291 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Access Services Technicians provide support to the Access Services department of Falvey Library. Technicians are responsible for conducting the following tasks: Provide in-person customer service at the library service desk. Conduct circulation transactions for patrons and answer patron questions. Search for materials in the library catalog for patrons and direct patrons to reference librarians for research assistance. Process requests and materials for the Pickup&Go holds service. Answer incoming phone calls to the library service desk. Shelve returned books and maintain book stacks. Move book carts. Lift and carry books. Search for missing books. Process interlibrary loan materials and update records in specialized library software and systems. Scan pages from journals and books for electronic delivery. Ship materials to other libraries via Fed-Ex software. Open incoming packages and sort contents for processing. Retrieve materials from local and remote locations. Perform light clerical work, routine office tasks, and run errands as directed. Participate and contribute to library projects assigned by Access Services staff. Requirements: Excellent verbal and written communication skills, attention to detail, and reliability are all required. Ability to perform repetitive tasks with great accuracy and consistency required. Excellent interpersonal skills; able to handle difficult situations; customer service experience preferred. Experience using hardware (laptops, PCs, printers, scanners, mobile devices), software (Windows, Mac, web browsers, Webmail, Brightspace), and wireless network access preferred. Familiarity with the library’s catalog, journals, databases, and web search engines preferred. Cross training in multiple areas required. Preference will be given to students who have availability in the evenings and weekends. Additional Information: Library Service Hours Monday – Thursday: 8am-12am Friday: 8am-5pm Saturday: 9am-5pm Sunday: 12pm-12am Building Wildcard Access: 24/7 All student employees must complete hiring paperwork online before they can be hired. Also, new student employees must go to the Human Resources Office in person to show original forms of employment authorization and identification required for the I-9 form. Physical Demands Summary: Prolonged sitting, standing, and walking for up to 4 hours at a time; frequent bending and lifting; able to lift 30 lbs. of library materials while moving/walking; pushing and pulling a book truck (4 wheels) of library materials weighing between 50 and 100 lbs.; ability to climb several flights of stairs on an occasional basis. Wage Rate: $11.25/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
