    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/34159": {
      "title": "Recreation Marketing Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Recreation Marketing Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Recreation Marketing Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260069V Position Title: Recreation Marketing Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 4-8 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Davis Center Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 2 Department: 775-Athl - Intramurals Contact Name: Ashley Montecchio Vero Contact Phone/Extension: 6105196387 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: · Creating weekly social media posts to cover all areas of the recreation department, including club sports, fitness centers, intramurals, and aquatics. · Managing a social media calendar/schedule via Hootsuite · Maintaining waivers and tracking system for image/likeness usage on recreation marketing materials · Content and design creation for the Villanova recreation website and marketing materials to be dispersed around campus · Creating and publishing a monthly newsletter via MailChimp · Attending biweekly meetings to discuss upcoming marketing needs and projects · Various other marketing projects as assigned Requirements: · Working knowledge of various social media platforms including Facebook, Instagram (including Reels), Twitter, and TikTok – and staying up to date with current social media trends. · Ability to represent the Villanova recreation brand (including university color/verbiage guidelines) in a way that engages the target audience while reflecting Villanova’s mission and values appropriately. · Comfort with various marketing tools/software systems (or willingness to learn how to utilize them) including Canva, Hootsuite, Mailchimp, AEM , etc. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $10/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): 04/16/2026 Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Resume / Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Letters of Reference (uploaded by applicant) © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
