      "title": "Resource Technician",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Resource Technician Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Resource Technician To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260192V Position Title: Resource Technician Posting Type Student Hours/week: up to 30 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026 Summer Location St. Augustine Center Detailed Work Schedule Flexible. Number of positions: 2 Department: 908 - CLA&S IT Department Contact Name: Jonathan Graziola Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-5337 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: The CLAS IT Resource Technician’s scope of responsibilities range from but are not limited to training, equipment setup and basic troubleshooting as assigned by the Department of CLAS IT. Requirements: - Excellent skills in communication, customer service, and time management. - Individual training sessions. - Website maintenance. - Quality control of CLAS computer labs. - Assisting with hardware assemblies. - Inventory tracking. - Moving and delivery of equipment. - Other special projects as assigned. Additional Information: No technical experience is required. Student workers will receive training from CLAS IT staff. Physical Demands Summary: - Must be able to travel with a laptop. - Must be able to lift 20lbs. Wage Rate: 11.25/HR Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Y