    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36352": {
      "title": "Fitness Center Attendant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Fitness Center Attendant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Fitness Center Attendant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260079V Position Title: Fitness Center Attendant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 6-20 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 25 Department: 775-Athl - Intramurals Contact Name: Keith Lowery Contact Phone/Extension: 610 519 6561 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Welcome, greet and provide friendly assistance to facility users. Provide safe and effective instructions on the operation of all cardiovascular and weight training equipment. INSPECT , MAINTAIN and CLEAN all exercise equipment. Inform facility users of various Campus Recreation announcements. Enforce all facility and program policies. Perform miscellaneous duties as assigned. Requirements: Additional Information: Please only submit your availability form to the application for full consideration. Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $10/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
