    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/35915": {
      "title": "Undergraduate Teaching Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Undergraduate Teaching Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Undergraduate Teaching Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Faculty Chosen - Work Study students preferred but open to all students. Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20255575V Position Title: Undergraduate Teaching Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 8 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2025-2026 Academic Year Location Bartley Hall Detailed Work Schedule See Position Summary Information Below Number of positions: 10 Department: 219-Economics Contact Name: Johanna Roman Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-4370 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Responsible for maintaining and updating online database, including the use of WebCT, Excel, and Computer Graphics package. Programming may be required in Excel (computing numerical solutions to mathematical problems with no closed-form solution) and in other packages such as STATA . Responsibilities also include student assistance in office hours, using highly specialized knowledge to lead review sessions and provide feedback. Requirements: Work is diversified and involved, resulting in some unique problems. The individual must exercise judgment and make decisions based on precedent or standard operating procedures. The Teaching Assistant needs to have extensive knowledge of a special professional area or general knowledge of several areas and provide exceptional educational support and hold review sessions with Students enrolled in the course. Additional Information: This Teaching Assistant Position is Faculty Chosen Physical Demands Summary: N/A Wage Rate: $13.00/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): 09/30/2025 Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
