    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/34132": {
      "title": "Driver",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Driver Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Driver To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20255388V Position Title: Driver Posting Type Student Hours/week: 3-15 hours/ week Eligibility: Work Study ONLY Semester 2025-2026 Academic Year Location St. Rita's Hall Detailed Work Schedule The Driver will be assigned, based on their schedule, to drive weekly service programs to their service sites, serve alongside the group, and then drive them back to campus. The total hours per shift will be between 2 and 5. Number of positions: 4 Department: 971-St. Thomas of Villanova Center for the Common Good Contact Name: Farhad Wedee Contact Phone/Extension: 6105196578 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: This Federal Work Study position supports Community Service programs, primarily with the Sophomore Service Learning Community and outreach programs from the Center for the Common Good. Based on availability, the student will be scheduled to transport participants to weekly service sites, serve alongside the group, and then return them to campus. Shifts typically range from 2 to 5 hours. The student must be van certified by Villanova University or willing to obtain certification prior to the start date. Depending on placement, PA Act 153 clearances (child abuse, criminal, and FBI fingerprinting) may also be required. Requirements: Must have experience with driving and be van certified by the University. Must be a current Villanova University student with Federal Work Study eligibility. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $13.00/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
