    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36507": {
      "title": "CLAS External Relations &amp; Communications Graduate Student Worker",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | CLAS External Relations &amp; Communications Graduate Student Worker Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us CLAS External Relations & Communications Graduate Student Worker To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260132V Position Title: CLAS External Relations & Communications Graduate Student Worker Posting Type Graduate Assistant Hours/week: 15-20 Eligibility: Graduate Assistant Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Mendel Science Center Detailed Work Schedule Monday / Wednesday in office with additional remote work hours Number of positions: 1 Department: 903-Arts & Sciences External Relations Contact Name: Shannon Contact Phone/Extension: Groves Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: The College of Liberal Arts and Sciences’ Office of External Relations and Communications is seeking an hourly Graduate Assistant. This individual will support the team with projects including event support, creating agendas and meeting materials, drafting gift acknowledgment letters and other tasks as needed Requirements: Must be enrolled in a graduate program in the College of Liberal Arts and Sciences. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $18/hr Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): 09/30/2026 Open Until Filled No Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your