      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | General Office Assistants Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us General Office Assistants To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260160V Position Title: General Office Assistants Posting Type Student Hours/week: Up to 20 hours/week Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Vasey Hall Detailed Work Schedule Varies with class schedule each semester. Number of positions: 3 Department: 576-Dean, Professional Studies Contact Name: Keyonna Douglas Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-8024 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Provide administrative and operational support to the College of Professional Studies. This role will offer students professional experience while assisting staff, faculty, and students with day-to-day functions that support success. Requirements: Assist with general office tasks such as filing, scanning, copying, and organizing documents. Manage front desk responsibilities, including greeting visitors and responding to inquiries. Use systems such as Microsoft Office, Google Workspace, or institutional platforms. Data collection Assist college faculty/staff with special projects/initiatives. Other duties as assigned Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $10 per hour (Entry) Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled No Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a reg