    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36091": {
      "title": "Assistant Swimming Coach",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Assistant Swimming Coach Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Assistant Swimming Coach To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260307V Position Title: Assistant Swimming Coach Posting Type Staff Hours/week: 20 Eligibility: Graduate Assistant Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Detailed Work Schedule Mon-Wed-Fri 7-9AM/ 3:00-5:00 PM Tues-Thurs 1:00-3:30 PM Sat – 7-10 AM Number of positions: 1 Department: 743-Swimming - Women Contact Name: Rick Simpson Contact Phone/Extension: 6105194136 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Assist Head Coach in various aspects of the intercollegiate Swim and Dive program. -On-Deck coaching responsibilities as directed by the head coach. -Monitoring of CARA participation logs. -Involvement with PSA’s on a limited basis. - -Assistance at home meets. Candidate will have the option to assist at travel meets pending their schedule. -Conduct responsibilities within the full parameters of NCAA , Big East Conference and Villanova athletic department policies and bylaws. Requirements: -A proven background in the sport of NCAA D-1 Swimming and Diving. -At least 1 year of on-deck NCAA /Collegiate coaching experience. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $23.00/hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
