    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36562": {
      "title": "Graduate Assistant-Statistics",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Graduate Assistant-Statistics Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Graduate Assistant-Statistics To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260414V Position Title: Graduate Assistant-Statistics Posting Type Graduate Assistant Hours/week: 10 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Driscoll Hall Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 1 Department: 231-Dean-Nursing Contact Name: Maggie Brace Contact Phone/Extension: (610) 519-6806 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: This graduate assistant position will support research that is funded by the Substance Abuse and Mental Health Services Administration ( SAMHSA ). Responsibilities may include: - Completing required “responsible conduct of research” trainings for human subjects research - Preparing data for analysis, assessing missing data, and recoding variables - Planning and running statistical analyses in collaboration with faculty researchers - Producing code files, output, tables, and figures - Preparing electronic data collection forms and surveys. - Attending team meetings Requirements: Current enrollment in graduate program in applied statistics Proficiency with at least one statistical program (e.g., R, Stata) Experience with data preparation and analysis Attention to detail Ability to work collaboratively Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: 18.00 Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Letters of Reference (uploaded by applicant) © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
