    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36530": {
      "title": "Off-Campus Law School I",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Off-Campus Law School I Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Off-Campus Law School I To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260416V Position Title: Off-Campus Law School I Posting Type Student Hours/week: Varies Eligibility: Work Study ONLY Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Off-Campus Detailed Work Schedule Work schedule determined by off-campus employer. Number of positions: Varies Department: 242-Law School Administration Contact Name: Christopher Nicholson Contact Phone/Extension: (610) 519-7015 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: The Villanova University Charles Widger School of Law work study program may consist of a full range of law clerk responsibilities including legal research, drafting briefs, witness preparation and courtroom assistance. In addition, students may have the opportunity to participate or assist in trial preparation, observing court matters, and attending witness interviews or testimony. The eligible work-study position must be with a federal, state or local public agency or private non-profit organization where the work performed is in the public interest. Requirements: Must be a currently enrolled Charles Widger School of Law student receiving work-study funds. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $15.00 Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What semester(s) are you planning to work? Summer/Fall/Spring (Open Ended Question) * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
