    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/35987": {
      "title": "Undergraduate Research Assistant - Villanova ECE Scholars (VEURS)",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Undergraduate Research Assistant - Villanova ECE Scholars (VEURS) Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Undergraduate Research Assistant - Villanova ECE Scholars (VEURS) To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260309V Position Title: Undergraduate Research Assistant - Villanova ECE Scholars (VEURS) Posting Type Student Hours/week: 10 hours per week Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Drosdick Hall Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 5 per Semester Department: 204-Electrical and Computer Engineering Contact Name: Helen Cook Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-4970 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: The Villanova ECE Undergraduate Research Scholars ( VEURS ) Program provides support to sophomore, junior, and senior-level Electrical and Computer Engineering students conducting research under the supervision of ECE faculty. Applications are reviewed each semester, and reapplication is permitted. Prospective applicants must secure an ECE faculty research advisor and work out a research plan prior to applying. An application must include the following in PDF : One-page (cover letter) description of the proposed research developed signed by the faculty advisor Resume Requirements: ECE undergraduate students at the sophomore level or above. Additional Information: This position will be available each semester for five ECE undergraduate students at the sophomore level or above. Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: 15.00 Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): 04/13/2027 Open Until Filled No Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Other Document © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
