    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36130": {
      "title": "Undergraduate Research Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Undergraduate Research Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Undergraduate Research Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260353V Position Title: Undergraduate Research Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 5 hours/ week Eligibility: Work Study ONLY Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Drosdick Hall Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 1 Department: 205-Mechanical Engineering Contact Name: Jane Ni Contact Phone/Extension: 6105194981 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Research area: Data center modeling Description: Undergraduate researcher must be a senior in mechanical engineering who is eager to learn and apply modeling of data center cooling systems. Experience in MATLAB or similar software is desired. Requirements: Attention to detail; able to follow directions; science major preferred but not required. Previous lab experience a plus. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $15/hr Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What is your availability (days, times)? (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Document