    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/34018": {
      "title": "Undergraduate Lab Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Undergraduate Lab Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Undergraduate Lab Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260052V Position Title: Undergraduate Lab Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: >20 hours p/week Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Drosdick Hall Detailed Work Schedule Number of positions: 2 Department: 202-Civil and Environmental Engineering Contact Name: Dr. Erica Forgione Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-4960 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: An undergraduate student is needed to assist in microplastics analysis under the supervision of Dr. Kelly Good and Dr. Erica Forgione. The student will use a visual microscope to count and categorize particles. Data will be collected and analyzed via Microsoft Excel, R script, Lab Archives, and One Drive. Additional hands-on laboratory soils analysis may also be completed. Requirements: Student must b e able to conduct meticulous, repetitive work that requires high levels of precision. Experience with Microsoft Excel and coding required; R script and previous research experience preferred. Additional Information: Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $13.00 Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * What is your availability? (days and times) (Open Ended Question) Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
