    "https://jobs.villanova.edu/postings/36160": {
      "title": "Office Assistant",
      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | Office Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us Office Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. All applications must be sent through the Applicant Tracking System Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260361V Position Title: Office Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 10+; up to 20 hours per week Eligibility: Work Study ONLY Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Garey Hall Detailed Work Schedule Tuesdays and Thursdays anytime from 9am to 5pm. No weekend or evening hours. Number of positions: 2 Department: 102-Office of Education Abroad Contact Name: Carolina Favazza Contact Phone/Extension: 610-519-6412 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Office work of any kind including lobby reception, internet research, phone coverage, scanning, training, data entry, reporting, etc. Requirements: Good interpersonal skills required. Position requires interaction with students & employees. Ability to deal discreetly with sensitive information. Additional Information: Only students who completed a FASFA will be considered. No graduate students please. Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: $10 per hour Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (Open Ended Question) * What hours can you work? (weekdays, between 9:00 AM and 5:00 PM only) (Open Ended Question) * I understand that satisfactory attendance in all academic classes is required to maintain student employment at Villanova University. Yes No Optional Applicant Documents: Required Documents Cover Letter / Letter of Interest Resume / Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents © 1990-2022 Villanova University. All Rights Reserved. 800 Lancaster Avenue · Villanova, PA 19085 · (610) 519-6000 · Privacy & Security Return to the Top    Villanova University To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
