      "description": "Villanova University Employment Site | General Office Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Applicant FAQ HR Homepage Security report Title IX About Us General Office Assistant To apply to this position, click on the Apply for this Job button below. If you have questions about the application process, please refer to the Applicant FAQ link on the sidebar. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Do you have questions about the application process? If so, please refer to the Applicant FAQ’s. Position Information Posting Number: 20260368V Position Title: General Office Assistant Posting Type Student Hours/week: 4-12 Eligibility: Work study preferred but open to all students Semester 2026-2027 Academic Year Location Driscoll Hall Detailed Work Schedule Office hours are between 9:00 – 5:00. Hours needed: T/Th – AM hours between 8:30 – 11:30; Wed/Th/Fri – PM hours between 12:00 – 5:00 Number of positions: 1 Department: 232-Nursing Contact Name: Theresa Hoffman-Lare Contact Phone/Extension: 6105194909 Position Summary Information Job Description Summary: Office work including but not limited to – reception, phone coverage, scanning, mailings, filing, data entry, scheduling appointments, internet research, etc. Requirements: Good interpersonal skills required. Position requires interaction with guests, students, faculty & staff. Ability to deal discreetly with sensitive information. Additional Information: Preference for a non-nursing student, but nursing students may apply. Physical Demands Summary: Wage Rate: 10.00 Posting Detail Information Closing Date (11:59pm ET): Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a registered Villanova student? Yes No * Are you eligible for work study? Yes No I don't know * Have you ever worked on campus before? If “Y”, what department and semester/year? (